WEBVTT

00:13.109 --> 00:15.405
Ouch, ouch, ouch.

00:43.378 --> 00:44.297
Okay!

00:44.965 --> 00:47.846
Hey! There you are, Big Sis Mutsumi!

00:47.846 --> 00:49.600
What is it, Nanao?

00:49.808 --> 00:51.019
I found it!

00:51.019 --> 00:54.066
YOZAKURA SECRET ARTS
A recipe for alleviating the exhaustion
brought on by Yozakura blood.

00:54.066 --> 00:56.864
Oh, wow! Thanks, Nanao!

00:56.864 --> 00:57.741
Here.

00:58.576 --> 01:00.913
But will you be all right?

01:00.913 --> 01:03.126
It all seems pretty dangerous, you know.

01:03.919 --> 01:05.923
Morning, Mutsumi! Nanao!

01:05.923 --> 01:07.009
-Taiyo!
-Big Bro!

01:07.343 --> 01:09.138
Should you be up and about?

01:09.138 --> 01:11.518
Sure. I got plenty of rest,

01:11.518 --> 01:13.480
and I shouldn't be
the only one lazing around--

01:15.652 --> 01:17.071
What did I tell you?

01:17.071 --> 01:19.075
I-I'm totally fine.

01:19.075 --> 01:21.079
It's just some mild muscle cramps.

01:21.705 --> 01:24.920
Anyway, Mutsumi,
you still can't leave the house?

01:25.420 --> 01:28.719
That's right. Since there's
no telling what could happen,

01:28.719 --> 01:31.767
Big Bro and the others said
I should stay home a little longer.

01:31.767 --> 01:32.936
I see.

01:34.397 --> 01:38.405
Come on, Big Bro Taiyo. You should
be resting up a little longer, too.

01:38.405 --> 01:41.494
Thanks, but I'm okay.

01:41.995 --> 01:45.043
I shouldn't take too much time off
from school, or it will look weird.

01:45.043 --> 01:45.878
Nanao!

01:46.212 --> 01:47.507
Huh?

01:47.507 --> 01:51.180
Would you mind going to school
with Taiyo today?

01:51.682 --> 01:53.268
Hey, good idea!

01:53.268 --> 01:54.729
Sure, I'll do it!

01:54.729 --> 01:57.735
I'll let Big Bro and the others know.
I'm counting on you!

01:57.735 --> 01:58.863
Roger that!

01:59.363 --> 02:01.200
Uh, Ms. Mutsumi…

02:01.200 --> 02:03.956
I'm fine with going
to school with Nanao, but, um…

02:04.457 --> 02:07.672
showing up in that outfit…

02:07.672 --> 02:09.801
Huh? Oh, that's right.

02:09.801 --> 02:13.224
You still haven't seen
the real Nanao yet, have you?

02:13.224 --> 02:14.811
The real Nanao?

02:15.061 --> 02:17.274
Now that you mention it,
I don't think he has.

02:18.234 --> 02:19.069
Huh?

02:25.123 --> 02:26.459
Hmm.

02:27.294 --> 02:30.217
Maybe I shrunk myself a little too much?

02:30.801 --> 02:33.139
That took longer than usual, didn't it?

02:33.139 --> 02:34.058
You think so?

02:34.308 --> 02:36.020
And who, pray tell, are you?

02:50.257 --> 02:59.860
MISSION: YOZAKURA FAMILY

04:07.494 --> 04:13.674
PLAN 17
NANAO'S MEDICINE

04:13.674 --> 04:14.843
What's the matter?

04:15.093 --> 04:20.145
Uh, it's just that
it still hasn't sunken in for real yet

04:20.145 --> 04:22.734
that the Nanao I know looks like this now.

04:22.734 --> 04:25.238
My skill is Immunity.

04:25.238 --> 04:30.206
I have a unique body that can neutralize
poison and enhance itself physically,

04:30.206 --> 04:32.335
but it's not easy to control.

04:32.628 --> 04:36.595
That's why I can lead
a more stable day-to-day life

04:36.595 --> 04:38.347
by keeping it slightly mutated.

04:40.686 --> 04:43.859
And so when I go to school,
I use a drug that I invented myself

04:43.859 --> 04:48.535
called Super Swelling Reducer
to forcibly suppress the mutation.

04:48.786 --> 04:53.504
I mean, you have to admit, a 3-meter-tall
high school kid would really stick out.

04:54.547 --> 04:56.927
The swelling hasn't gone down there!

04:57.845 --> 04:59.557
I guess it's because I'm an adolescent?

04:59.557 --> 05:00.935
Looking forward to school!

05:02.563 --> 05:03.899
Is this going to work?

05:08.074 --> 05:09.786
Okay, see you later!

05:09.786 --> 05:10.830
Yeah.

05:10.830 --> 05:12.625
Hey, it's Nanao!

05:13.334 --> 05:14.587
You're right.

05:15.088 --> 05:16.675
Morning, you guys!

05:16.675 --> 05:18.554
Are you feeling okay?

05:18.554 --> 05:20.933
Yeah, never felt better!

05:20.933 --> 05:21.893
That's great!

05:21.893 --> 05:23.730
We made copies of our notes for you, okay?

05:28.657 --> 05:29.826
Hey, what's up?

05:39.261 --> 05:41.181
Is she planning to poison someone?

05:41.181 --> 05:42.309
Maybe.

05:47.945 --> 05:50.283
Music class sure is a drag, huh?

05:50.283 --> 05:54.374
Oh, crap! I didn't do my English homework.

05:54.374 --> 05:57.506
Man, you're so screwed
if you piss off Xavier!

05:57.840 --> 05:59.051
Right, Asano?

05:59.051 --> 06:02.307
Huh? Yeah, I guess so.

06:02.307 --> 06:04.520
That'll get you extra homework
to the tune of 50%!

06:04.520 --> 06:05.773
For real?

06:05.773 --> 06:07.442
-Nanao?
-Good luck with that!

06:07.818 --> 06:09.196
We'll be going on ahead.

06:09.196 --> 06:10.532
Uh, right.

06:11.952 --> 06:13.412
What's wrong, Nanao?

06:13.412 --> 06:14.666
<i>Big Bro Taiyo…</i>

06:17.462 --> 06:20.594
I can hear something
really gross going on.

06:20.594 --> 06:24.560
<i>Um, let's see. Would you mind
coming over to the biology lab?</i>

06:25.061 --> 06:26.397
The biology lab?

06:26.397 --> 06:29.486
<i>Yeah. The sooner the better, I think.</i>

06:29.486 --> 06:31.198
BIOLOGY LAB
ENTRY BY OUTSIDERS PROHIBITED!

06:31.198 --> 06:32.325
Is this it?

06:33.202 --> 06:34.622
I'm coming in.

06:37.127 --> 06:37.962
Nanao?

06:38.755 --> 06:40.968
ATG…

06:41.678 --> 06:43.932
GTC…

06:44.726 --> 06:46.312
Nanao, you here?

06:47.188 --> 06:48.608
Nanao!

06:49.026 --> 06:50.696
Hey, Nanao! Hang in there!

06:51.321 --> 06:53.577
Hey, Big Bro Taiyo.

06:53.577 --> 06:55.038
Thanks for coming.

06:55.998 --> 06:57.167
Are you all right?

06:57.167 --> 07:01.467
I'm okay.
I'm just not feeling well, that's all.

07:01.467 --> 07:03.179
Can you give me those meds?

07:03.179 --> 07:04.222
You mean these?

07:05.851 --> 07:07.103
What should I do?

07:07.353 --> 07:11.738
Anywhere will do.
Inject me through to the hypodermis.

07:11.738 --> 07:12.656
Like this?

07:13.324 --> 07:15.078
It's working.

07:17.792 --> 07:21.340
Thanks, Big Bro Taiyo.
I've settled down now.

07:21.340 --> 07:23.804
Thank goodness! What the heck happened--

07:23.804 --> 07:24.722
Nanao?

07:25.766 --> 07:27.310
Ms. Kitasato?

07:27.310 --> 07:30.901
You never came back from feeding them, so…

07:31.528 --> 07:32.905
Are you feeling ill?

07:33.489 --> 07:34.491
Are you all right?

07:34.742 --> 07:37.915
Um, well, hey, this is just, uh--

07:38.792 --> 07:39.669
Is it anemia?

07:40.169 --> 07:42.550
But it's not like you're pale or anything.

07:43.969 --> 07:46.808
Your eyes are properly focused,
and you're not trembling.

07:46.808 --> 07:48.562
M-Ms. Kitasato.

07:48.812 --> 07:51.693
Don't move. I'm taking your temperature.

07:53.154 --> 07:57.412
To accommodate the python, the temperature
in this room is around 77 degrees,

07:57.412 --> 07:59.416
so at the moment, your body temp…

07:59.917 --> 08:03.132
is 98 degrees, which is normal.

08:05.261 --> 08:06.138
What?

08:08.184 --> 08:10.313
Your temperature's starting to spike.

08:10.313 --> 08:11.608
Maybe it's a cold, after all?

08:12.108 --> 08:15.574
You might want to go to the infirmary
just to be safe.

08:15.574 --> 08:18.162
I'll take care of the feeding later on.

08:18.162 --> 08:19.331
Feel better.

08:19.790 --> 08:22.713
S-Sure. Thank you.

08:23.548 --> 08:26.721
Huh? Am I not visible to you?

08:27.013 --> 08:30.771
Ms. Rinne Kitasato.
She's a classmate of mine

08:30.771 --> 08:32.733
and the president of the Biology Club.

08:33.234 --> 08:37.158
She has zero interest in humans
or mammals, so don't mind her, okay?

08:37.158 --> 08:38.787
What's up with that?

08:39.412 --> 08:42.085
But anyway, Nanao,
are you sure you're okay?

08:42.628 --> 08:45.216
Yeah. Sorry to give you a scare.

08:45.717 --> 08:49.684
I came here to get my backup meds,
but I didn't make it in time--

08:49.684 --> 08:50.852
Are you snacking?

08:53.482 --> 08:54.484
Nanao!

08:54.484 --> 08:57.240
I'm fine. I just need to calm down.

08:58.117 --> 09:01.749
ATCCGC…

09:03.628 --> 09:05.507
What was that chant?

09:06.091 --> 09:09.431
That's the base sequence of my DNA.

09:10.016 --> 09:12.813
Adenine, cytosine, guanine, thymine.

09:13.314 --> 09:17.322
All living creatures
are made of these four blocks.

09:17.823 --> 09:20.996
Cats have feline sequences,
dogs have canine sequences,

09:20.996 --> 09:22.916
and humans have human sequences.

09:23.585 --> 09:28.511
When I chant this, it makes me feel
as though I'm like everyone else,

09:28.511 --> 09:30.891
that I'm a normal human being.

09:31.141 --> 09:32.226
Nanao…

09:33.145 --> 09:36.986
But I think that I've reached
the end of the line with this ruse.

09:36.986 --> 09:37.863
Huh?

09:39.240 --> 09:40.159
What's that?

09:40.661 --> 09:43.583
A permanent vaccine.
If I inject myself with this,

09:43.583 --> 09:46.714
my body and soul
will never be unstable again.

09:47.173 --> 09:51.682
And I also won't be able
to return to this body ever again.

09:53.352 --> 09:56.274
Which means
that I can't ever come back to school.

09:57.235 --> 10:00.324
But the only reason I'm attending at all
is because I insisted,

10:00.324 --> 10:01.368
so I don't really mind.

10:02.328 --> 10:03.540
<i>Hey, but you…</i>

10:05.000 --> 10:06.336
<i>If you quit school…</i>

10:09.467 --> 10:10.554
<i>you'll never…</i>

10:11.054 --> 10:15.981
Okay, I'm going to tell Big Bro Kyoichiro
and start the withdrawal procedure.

10:20.991 --> 10:22.452
Big Bro Taiyo?

10:23.663 --> 10:25.667
What's wrong, Big Bro Taiyo?

10:25.959 --> 10:27.295
I'm so sorry.

10:27.796 --> 10:31.178
You've all done nothing but help me out,

10:31.679 --> 10:35.979
but I never realized what an ordeal
you've been going through all this time.

10:38.568 --> 10:41.657
These meds, if you can use them anytime,

10:42.158 --> 10:44.120
then there's no reason
to use them now, right?

10:45.164 --> 10:48.045
Nanao, I want you to give me a chance.

10:49.005 --> 10:51.511
I want to preserve your daily life.

10:56.562 --> 10:59.234
Thanks, Big Bro Taiyo.

11:00.194 --> 11:01.196
I'm counting on you!

11:04.912 --> 11:08.126
"And so,
the nighthawk star went on burning.

11:08.670 --> 11:11.299
It burned on, forever and ever--"

11:11.842 --> 11:12.678
MODERN LITERATURE

11:12.678 --> 11:15.015
Huh? Why did you stop?

11:15.015 --> 11:16.561
Hey, what happened to your clothes?

11:16.561 --> 11:20.025
Oh, well, looks like they're defective.

11:20.025 --> 11:22.029
What kind of defect is that?

11:22.531 --> 11:24.577
Go change into your gym sweats for now!

11:24.577 --> 11:25.704
Okay.

11:32.049 --> 11:33.928
Thanks, Big Bro.

11:36.182 --> 11:37.936
Hey! Yeah!

11:37.936 --> 11:38.897
All right!

11:38.897 --> 11:40.149
There it goes, Nanao!

11:41.569 --> 11:42.946
To second…

11:48.040 --> 11:49.500
O-Out!

11:51.756 --> 11:54.929
That was awesome, Nanao!
What a laser beam!

11:56.056 --> 11:58.018
Thanks to the wind, I guess?

12:06.661 --> 12:09.667
All right, guys, it's time to eat.

12:10.167 --> 12:11.837
I'll get it ready for you right away.

12:39.350 --> 12:43.358
But seriously,
you sure did a number on this place.

12:43.358 --> 12:47.909
Right. And now we have to do
a complete renovation on the mansion.

12:48.201 --> 12:50.372
So? What are they after?

12:50.999 --> 12:52.919
Mutsumi, of course.

12:53.713 --> 12:56.384
Jeez, so they still
haven't given up on that?

12:58.598 --> 13:01.979
I'll do some digging on my end
to see what they're up to.

13:01.979 --> 13:03.566
We really owe you one.

13:03.566 --> 13:04.860
Don't give it another thought.

13:05.779 --> 13:07.281
That goes for you guys, too.

13:07.281 --> 13:08.241
No, no.

13:08.241 --> 13:10.078
Hey, it's totally cool.

13:10.412 --> 13:14.128
You guys, Mutsumi
made these herself for you.

13:14.128 --> 13:15.757
Want to try some?

13:15.757 --> 13:18.053
What, for real? Thanks!

13:18.053 --> 13:19.180
Don't mind if I do.

13:20.015 --> 13:22.186
Ahh…

13:22.478 --> 13:27.238
How do you like these tranquilizing
pressure points that Ayaka showed me?

13:27.238 --> 13:29.910
Love them. I'm really feeling this.

13:30.494 --> 13:35.212
Just knowing that you're
protecting me, Big Bro Taiyo,

13:35.212 --> 13:37.843
is enough to gradually
ease all these attacks.

13:38.343 --> 13:41.892
I might be able
to keep coming to school a little longer.

13:42.393 --> 13:44.648
Thanks, Big Bro Taiyo!

13:45.190 --> 13:46.401
Nanao…

13:47.486 --> 13:48.363
Huh?

13:50.952 --> 13:54.041
Hydra and Orochi! What are you doing here?

13:56.045 --> 13:56.922
No way.

14:00.012 --> 14:01.599
All the animals!

14:02.057 --> 14:03.226
What the heck happened?

14:03.728 --> 14:04.646
Whoa!

14:06.107 --> 14:07.151
Ms. Kitasato!

14:13.079 --> 14:14.833
She's just passed out.

14:16.169 --> 14:18.799
Is that one of Basilisk's scales?

14:19.133 --> 14:23.517
But it's abnormally huge,
and it's tumorous. It's like…

14:24.060 --> 14:26.189
a side effect
of my medicine!

14:27.024 --> 14:28.527
It's all my fault.

14:28.527 --> 14:29.613
Huh?

14:29.905 --> 14:32.619
Basilisk ate
one of the capsules I dropped,

14:32.619 --> 14:34.163
and it's messed him up!

14:34.163 --> 14:35.082
Seriously?

14:38.129 --> 14:39.340
Ms. Kitasato?

14:40.885 --> 14:42.639
We've got to find Basilisk!

14:43.431 --> 14:45.520
Wait! I'll go look for him!

14:45.520 --> 14:47.899
You need to rest, Ms. Kitasato!

14:47.899 --> 14:49.861
I have no idea what happened,

14:50.530 --> 14:54.120
but that look of pain on his face,
that I remember clearly.

14:54.120 --> 14:55.080
I've got to save him!

14:55.288 --> 14:56.542
Ms. Kitasato!

14:58.086 --> 14:59.548
Go with her, Nanao!

15:00.800 --> 15:03.179
You can leave these guys to me!

15:05.350 --> 15:06.185
Okay!

15:06.603 --> 15:08.566
Thanks, Big Bro Taiyo!

15:08.566 --> 15:11.320
A lot of those guys are venomous,
so watch your back, all right?

15:11.320 --> 15:14.160
What? But I've already
been bitten like crazy!

15:14.160 --> 15:16.665
BOILER ROOM

15:17.166 --> 15:19.253
High heat, high humidity, dark room…

15:19.755 --> 15:24.096
just the kind of environment he likes,
so he usually comes here when he runs off.

15:24.723 --> 15:28.063
Come on out, Basilisk! It's snack time!

15:28.063 --> 15:30.233
<i>You sure are strong, Ms. Kitasato.</i>

15:30.818 --> 15:33.616
Basilisk! You're here, aren't you?

15:35.410 --> 15:38.626
<i>This environment
is conducive to cell stimulation.</i>

15:39.460 --> 15:42.257
<i>Basilisk's at risk of getting worse, too.</i>

15:44.136 --> 15:44.971
Look out!

15:50.775 --> 15:53.572
Basilisk! It's just me and Nanao!

15:53.572 --> 15:54.406
Get back!

15:58.373 --> 16:02.339
<i>No good. Not only is he gigantic, but
he's also in a state of total confusion!</i>

16:06.013 --> 16:07.684
We're going to make a run for the exit!

16:13.069 --> 16:14.071
Ms. Kitasato!

16:20.167 --> 16:24.634
<i>Sorry, Basilisk, Ms. Kitasato.</i>

16:25.887 --> 16:28.601
<i>This never would have happened
if it hadn't been for me.</i>

16:35.615 --> 16:36.825
Ms. Kitasato.

16:38.787 --> 16:40.165
Thanks for everything till now.

16:40.415 --> 16:41.334
Nanao!

16:44.925 --> 16:47.680
This is going to hurt a little. Sorry.

16:48.348 --> 16:52.356
The side effects from this medicine
can be neutralized by my mutated cells.

16:52.857 --> 16:54.653
You'll be feeling better soon.

16:55.237 --> 16:57.074
Nanao?

17:02.877 --> 17:04.213
Both of you!

17:06.635 --> 17:07.804
Basilisk!

17:08.555 --> 17:10.100
N-Nanao!

17:10.308 --> 17:11.310
What was that…

17:13.273 --> 17:14.358
Nanao?

17:20.788 --> 17:24.420
I'm sorry
that I caused you so much trouble.

17:25.046 --> 17:28.344
I was supposed to be
accompanying you today.

17:28.344 --> 17:30.766
What are you talking about? Don't worry.

17:32.144 --> 17:34.983
We made it. No one will be coming up here.

17:35.317 --> 17:37.780
Thanks, Big Bro Taiyo.

17:38.281 --> 17:42.957
No problem. I mean, it was
good poison training for me, too.

17:51.349 --> 17:52.225
Nanao!

17:53.562 --> 17:57.570
Because I let up on my mutations,
I ended up losing control over them.

17:58.614 --> 18:02.037
But now I'm finally resigned to it all.

18:02.287 --> 18:04.751
Hold up, Nanao. If you use that…

18:05.251 --> 18:08.675
Ms. Kitasato saw me like this, so…

18:09.969 --> 18:11.765
I'm fine with it now.

18:12.432 --> 18:16.357
Thanks to you, Big Bro Taiyo,
I was able to fight to the end…

18:16.942 --> 18:18.152
so I have no regrets.

18:18.152 --> 18:19.071
Wait a sec--

18:20.533 --> 18:24.373
See? I can't even hold back anymore.

18:24.373 --> 18:27.003
That was me
just trying to brush you off lightly.

18:27.337 --> 18:29.466
Nanao… don't do it!

18:29.466 --> 18:34.686
The school life I led, pretending
to be normal when I'm not normal…

18:35.019 --> 18:35.896
is over now.

18:45.750 --> 18:48.087
It's all right, Nanao.

18:48.797 --> 18:51.010
Just take some deep breaths.

18:51.636 --> 18:53.222
Big Bro.

18:54.391 --> 18:58.441
Come on, now. You have that chant
for times like this, right?

18:58.441 --> 19:00.487
The one where you
go "A" and "C" and stuff…

19:01.071 --> 19:02.199
Let's hear you recite it.

19:05.121 --> 19:08.461
ATG…

19:09.213 --> 19:12.553
-CGTA…
-That's right.

19:12.553 --> 19:13.680
You keep that up.

19:13.889 --> 19:15.893
CG…

19:16.811 --> 19:18.565
-CTA…
-You know…

19:19.066 --> 19:21.320
I had a little brother,
so I think I should know.

19:22.197 --> 19:25.579
You are a normal kid brother.

19:26.581 --> 19:28.209
Your big bro is here for you.

19:28.710 --> 19:30.255
You've got nothing to worry about.

19:31.423 --> 19:34.221
You put up a good fight! That's my Nanao!

19:35.306 --> 19:37.185
Big Bro Taiyo…

19:38.062 --> 19:39.524
…thank you.

19:41.987 --> 19:44.576
I'm sorry. That must have hurt, huh?

19:44.576 --> 19:46.412
Huh? I didn't feel a thing!

19:46.412 --> 19:48.834
But if possible,
please pull it out gently.

19:49.836 --> 19:51.965
So it does hurt, after all.

19:52.299 --> 19:55.013
Salamander, there you are!

19:56.181 --> 19:58.477
I finally rounded you all up.

20:01.066 --> 20:03.154
Oh. You startled me.

20:03.154 --> 20:06.368
M-Ms. Kitasato!
How long have you been here?

20:06.828 --> 20:12.339
Um… since he said, "We made it.
No one will be coming up here."

20:12.339 --> 20:14.761
From the start!

20:14.761 --> 20:15.804
Never mind that.

20:16.180 --> 20:18.100
I had no idea.

20:18.100 --> 20:18.935
Huh?

20:19.311 --> 20:21.065
Who would have thought that you--

20:22.610 --> 20:25.031
You've got the wrong idea! That was--

20:25.031 --> 20:28.496
TRANSFORMATION AS ENVIRONMENTAL RESPONSE
That you were capable of metamorphosis?

20:30.083 --> 20:30.918
-Meta--
-Meta--

20:31.460 --> 20:34.717
<i>So she's convinced
by her own unique interpretation?</i>

20:34.926 --> 20:36.303
By the way, you--

20:36.303 --> 20:37.932
Huh? Y-Yes?

20:37.932 --> 20:43.025
I saw you in the lab earlier,
and you seem quite close to Nanao.

20:43.025 --> 20:45.321
Oh, u-uh…

20:45.321 --> 20:50.749
<i>Oh, crap. The fact that we're family
is a secret from the public!</i>

20:51.166 --> 20:52.293
Let me guess.

20:52.293 --> 20:54.464
You'd like to join our club, right?

20:56.761 --> 20:58.431
You're more than welcome!

20:58.724 --> 21:00.644
You can even just be a member on paper.

21:00.644 --> 21:03.734
Come on,
let's go fill out your application.

21:03.734 --> 21:05.069
H-Hey, hold up!

21:05.696 --> 21:07.658
Oh. Nanao?

21:08.869 --> 21:11.457
I don't know what you're
so anxious about…

21:12.375 --> 21:14.379
but don't quit the Biology Club, okay?

21:14.379 --> 21:17.887
I don't know what I'd do if I didn't have
someone to help me look after everyone.

21:19.473 --> 21:20.851
Ms. Kitasato!

21:22.980 --> 21:23.815
Whoa.

21:23.815 --> 21:26.111
Now, then, let's get going.

21:26.111 --> 21:27.531
Uh, actually-- H-Hey!

21:27.531 --> 21:30.286
Nanao! Help me!

21:41.684 --> 21:43.187
We're home!

21:44.774 --> 21:45.651
Huh?

21:48.030 --> 21:50.159
Hey there! Welcome home, you two.

21:50.661 --> 21:51.746
Ms. Rin?

21:51.996 --> 21:53.583
Welcome home.

21:53.583 --> 21:56.463
Huh? Mutsumi? What happened here, exactly?

21:56.463 --> 21:58.467
Hey! Don't tell me…

21:59.135 --> 21:59.971
Yes.

22:00.681 --> 22:03.770
I thought it would heal
your exhaustion, Taiyo,

22:03.770 --> 22:06.818
so I made these secret-recipe rice cakes.

22:06.818 --> 22:07.653
But…

22:08.028 --> 22:11.118
it seems like the side effects
make you black out first.

22:11.326 --> 22:13.497
Black out from the side effects?

22:16.504 --> 22:19.134
Why is she the only one
who's not affected?

22:19.134 --> 22:21.556
Because she's tireless, maybe?

22:22.056 --> 22:23.183
Hmm?

22:23.183 --> 22:25.689
Mutsumi did go to the trouble
of making these.

22:25.689 --> 22:27.526
You guys should dig in, too.

22:27.818 --> 22:30.657
Right, you know what to do,
right, Mr. Nanao?

22:30.657 --> 22:33.997
Yes! I'll go concoct
an antidote right away!

24:06.223 --> 24:10.982
NEXT TIME
YOZAKURA HOT SPRING STORY
